{"5147980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DELIVERX", "steam_appid": 5147980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a parcel delivery driver isn't as easy as it might seem, especially in cities with no service. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to deliver parcels and level up as you go, and the number of parcels you need to deliver increases every day, so don't relax. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're slow or don't deliver all the parcels on time, who knows what will happen to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/2c094fc381ed3657fd69e1af4b5ac79c.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/2c094fc381ed3657fd69e1af4b5ac79c.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work in delivery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and three of your friends will have to load up the packages and deliver them to the houses whose numbers you will be given. Just keep your eyes peeled, because sometimes the residents of a house leave and never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0cd4a81401aa03909f4f14fc0e8eb1a0.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/0cd4a81401aa03909f4f14fc0e8eb1a0.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/ac48de4724930cecd53600e6ba1f99e1.poster.avif?t=1788031906\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/ac48de4724930cecd53600e6ba1f99e1.webm?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/ac48de4724930cecd53600e6ba1f99e1.mp4?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some residents of this city have ceased to be human...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're prepared to warn you that there will be residents on your way who won't be happy about your presence, and some will be ravenously hungry...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/84728e20b8d33ec598d335ee2c4ed5ee.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/84728e20b8d33ec598d335ee2c4ed5ee.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/3e96582121ae57a72ac57a4f9d4237c9.poster.avif?t=1788031906\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/3e96582121ae57a72ac57a4f9d4237c9.webm?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/3e96582121ae57a72ac57a4f9d4237c9.mp4?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But don't forget the main thing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main task is to deliver packages, otherwise millions will die. If you need weapons or supplies, buy them at Dave's store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/a9bc478e07b9597eaca91b1981d9c689.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/a9bc478e07b9597eaca91b1981d9c689.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0a75b92ca9c40c741629e785a1196f06.poster.avif?t=1788031906\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0a75b92ca9c40c741629e785a1196f06.webm?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0a75b92ca9c40c741629e785a1196f06.mp4?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peculiarities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parcel delivery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Supplies Store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three scary monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parcel delivery vehicle</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a parcel delivery driver isn't as easy as it might seem, especially in cities with no service. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to deliver parcels and level up as you go, and the number of parcels you need to deliver increases every day, so don't relax. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're slow or don't deliver all the parcels on time, who knows what will happen to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/2c094fc381ed3657fd69e1af4b5ac79c.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/2c094fc381ed3657fd69e1af4b5ac79c.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work in delivery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and three of your friends will have to load up the packages and deliver them to the houses whose numbers you will be given. Just keep your eyes peeled, because sometimes the residents of a house leave and never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0cd4a81401aa03909f4f14fc0e8eb1a0.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/0cd4a81401aa03909f4f14fc0e8eb1a0.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/ac48de4724930cecd53600e6ba1f99e1.poster.avif?t=1788031906\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/ac48de4724930cecd53600e6ba1f99e1.webm?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/ac48de4724930cecd53600e6ba1f99e1.mp4?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some residents of this city have ceased to be human...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're prepared to warn you that there will be residents on your way who won't be happy about your presence, and some will be ravenously hungry...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/84728e20b8d33ec598d335ee2c4ed5ee.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/84728e20b8d33ec598d335ee2c4ed5ee.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/3e96582121ae57a72ac57a4f9d4237c9.poster.avif?t=1788031906\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/3e96582121ae57a72ac57a4f9d4237c9.webm?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/3e96582121ae57a72ac57a4f9d4237c9.mp4?t=1788031906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But don't forget the main thing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main task is to deliver packages, otherwise millions will die. If you need weapons or supplies, buy them at Dave's store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/a9bc478e07b9597eaca91b1981d9c689.avif?t=1788031906\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras_big/a9bc478e07b9597eaca91b1981d9c689.webp?t=1788031906 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0a75b92ca9c40c741629e785a1196f06.poster.avif?t=1788031906\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147980/extras/0a75b92ca9c40c741629e785a1196f06.webm?