Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system. Microphone required for voice chat.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Broadband Internet connection and microphone required for optimal co-op experience.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU or Intel Iris Plus Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard Audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires 64-bit processor and operating system. Microphone required for voice chat.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0 (Monterey) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Pro / M2 or Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Pro GPU / AMD Radeon Pro 5500M<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard Audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Broadband Internet connection and microphone required for optimal co-op experience.</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280 (Mesa driver with Vulkan / OpenGL 4.5 support)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA / PulseAudio compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires 64-bit processor and operating system. Microphone required for voice chat.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA / PulseAudio compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Broadband Internet connection and microphone required for optimal co-op experience.</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Sera"], "publishers": ["Vector"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id"